  "description": "The Kids' Bike is designed to help young riders build confidence and coordination in a safe and enjoyable way. Ideal for children aged 2 to 5, this bike features a durable steel frame and a kid-friendly soft saddle that offers a comfortable fit for extended outdoor play. The handlebar and seat are both height adjustable, allowing the bike to grow with your child and accommodate kids from 31.5\" to 37.4\" in height. With removable training wheels, children can transition smoothly from assisted to independent riding. The front and rear V-brake system, controlled by easy-reach hand brakes designed for smaller hands, offers reliable stopping power and improves control. Additional safety features include a full chain guard to prevent pinching and rust-resistant fenders to keep clothes clean. No more worrying about hard-to-reach brakes or unstable stops—this bike empowers kids to ride safely on sidewalks, in parks, or around the neighborhood. The included bell adds fun while teaching road awareness. Whether your child is just beginning or improving their skills, this bike offers a smooth and secure riding experience.\n\nSize Guide:\n\n12\" Wheel: Age 2–5 | Height 31.5–37.4\" | Saddle Height 15.8–19.7\" | Handlebar 23.6–26.0\"\n\nAdjustable Growing Design & Durable Frame: This kids bike features a sturdy steel frame with tool-free height adjustment for both handlebars and seat, allowing the children's bicycle to grow with your child from ages 2 to 5 while ensuring stability and long-term use.",
